    "For actual lip colours consult semantic_features.mouth.source_colors and the red mask/regions. Shared lip pigments remain in skin to avoid duplicating RGBs between groups. Peach cheeks are ordinary skin shading, not a separate pink blush layer; no pink pixels are invented.",
