    "regions uses zero-based source-sheet pixel coordinates and runs [y,x,length]. These embedded runs exactly reconstruct the masks and permit future runtime spatial gating without loading review PNGs. They describe raw source frames before the game aligns/mirrors them. No game code is changed.",
